:: Mage Setup
<<set $player_class to "Mage">>
<<set $strength to 8>>
<<set $agility to 13>>
<<set $intelligence to 15>>
<<set $vitality to 10>>
<<set $max_hp to 50>>
<<set $hp to 50>>
<<set $inventory to ["Staff", "Spellbook", "Robes", "Traveler's Clothes"]>>
<<set $has_iron_sword to false>>

# The Mage's Path

You are $player_name, a scholar of the arcane. Your power lies not in the sword-arm but in the mind. Years of study have given you knowledge -- and a few tricks.

''Starting Stats:''
- Strength: $strength
- Agility: $agility
- Intelligence: $intelligence
- Vitality: $vitality
- HP: $hp / $max_hp
- Gold: $gold
- Inventory: <<print $inventory.join(", ")>>

You feel ready to face whatever Thornwood has in store.

[[Enter Thornwood|Town Square]]
